Add only-touch/only-desktop CSS near touch controls. Also maybe `body.touch .only-desktop { display:none }`. But careful: `.only-desktop` is used only in death action. Use:
```
.only-touch { display:none; }
body.touch .only-touch { display:inline; }
body.touch .only-desktop { display:none; }
```
Add after body.touch rules. Also style b in death action? Death action font; b inherits. Good.

Also the energy hint: update ui.js to choose touch text. Let's do both.

