Now, phase platforms warning. Let's add a subtle warning when about to deactivate. In drawPlatform for phase:
```
const cyc = ((time + (p.phase||0)) % (p.period||3)) / (p.period||3);
const remain = active ? ((p.duty||.6) - cyc) * (p.period||3) : 0;
const warning = active && remain < .45;
```
But `time` passed is `game.worldTime`? Let's check renderer call.

